                            <p class="focus-req-desc mb-0">On-time delivery, defect rejection rate &amp; process closing cycle durations.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ── Slide Footer Note ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="text-center text-muted pb-3" style="font-size: 0.72rem;">
        This Graph/Chart is linked to live ERP Production Data, and changes automatically based on operational process updates.
    </div>

</div>

